# ...but the GQH bit-exactness vectors are fixture INPUTS, not build output. The
# blanket *.bin above silently swallowed them, which is why test-gqh-{cpu-decode,backend}
# fail on a fresh clone: the .decode.f32/.meta.json halves are tracked and the .wire.bin
# half is not.
!deps/llama.cpp/tests/gqh-vectors/*.wire.bin
